{
  "name": "Shared Budget · 9 Lab",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Shared Budget · Lab\nTwo counters without a reservation, for measuring. Not for production.\n\n- `budget/lab/dt-read-then-add`: Data Table: read spent, check, call, read again, write spent + cost\n- `budget/lab/pg-check-then-add`: Postgres: SELECT spent, check, call, UPDATE spent = spent + cost\n\nSame body as the example run. `budget/lab/open` creates the counter rows, `budget/lab/spent` reads them. The tests start several runs at once and compare what the model stand-in billed with the cap.",
        "width": 700,
        "height": 300,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "16a75d40-3d07-44fd-83c6-5abf057a9c2c",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -420
      ]
    },
